# oracle: pair_style lj/long/coul/long off long 7.0 (flag_lj off: the LJ terms as flag_lj cut, the pair keeps native's dispersion flag) with kspace_style pppm/disp (Coulomb only, fixed gewald and mesh), the default Coulomb table, 27 charged displaced sc atoms, run 0 then 20 NVE steps
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 3.9e-14, atoms 2.1e-15.
units           real
atom_style      charge
lattice         sc 3.0
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
set             type 1 type/fraction 2 0.5 4321
set             type 1 charge 1.0
set             type 2 charge -1.0
mass            * 20.0
displace_atoms  all random 0.2 0.2 0.2 777
velocity        all create 300 4928 loop geom
pair_style      lj/long/coul/long off long 7.0
pair_coeff      * * 0.1 2.5
kspace_style    pppm/disp 1.0e-5
kspace_modify   gewald 0.3 mesh 10 10 10
timestep        1.0
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step pe ecoul elong evdwl ke press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          5
run             0
run             20
